{
  "days": ["2026-09-15", "2026-09-16"],
  "entries": [
    {
      "day": "2026-09-15",
      "kind": "text",
      "position": 1,
      "body": "Bags on the scale, passports in the front pocket, predictions sealed in an envelope Leo is not allowed to open. The departure board said Tokyo and everyone went quiet for a second."
    },
    {
      "day": "2026-09-15",
      "kind": "quote",
      "position": 2,
      "body": "I am going to eat seven kinds of onigiri before lunch. — Saga"
    },
    {
      "day": "2026-09-16",
      "kind": "text",
      "position": 1,
      "body": "Landed at 07:55 looking like laundry. Suica on the phone, bags in a locker, then the first konbini — onigiri, egg sandwiches, canned coffee. Rikke cried a bit at Kaminarimon, in a good way. We were in bed by eight."
    },
    {
      "day": "2026-09-16",
      "kind": "quote",
      "position": 2,
      "body": "The egg sandwich is the best thing that has ever happened. — Leo"
    }
  ],
